  <refbody>
    <section id="detailed-changes" outputclass="detailed-changes-by-jurisdiction">
      <title>Detailed Changes by Jurisdiction</title>
      <p outputclass="overview"><b>Overview:</b> Registration threshold, rate,
        taxability/exemption rule, and tax code changes for this release are described below,
        organized by jurisdiction and tax type. This is the sole primary section &#8212;
        jurisdiction and effective date are captured within each entry rather than in a separate
        summary table.</p>

      <!-- ============ COUNTRY / BLOC: European Union (Pattern A - isolated change) ============ -->
      <div outputclass="country-card">
        <p outputclass="country-header"><b>European Union</b></p>
        <div outputclass="country-body">
          <p outputclass="taxtype-label">Value Added Tax (VAT)</p>
          <div outputclass="change-card">
            <p outputclass="change-title"><b>Domestic VAT Out-of-Scope Expansion</b></p>
            <dl outputclass="change-fields">
              <dlentry>
                <dt>Citation</dt>
                <dd>EU Commission Directive 2026/X42</dd>
              </dlentry>
              <dlentry>
                <dt>Effective Date</dt>
                <dd>2026-05-21</dd>
              </dlentry>
              <dlentry>
                <dt>Description</dt>
                <dd>The Domestic VAT Out-of-Scope provision was expanded to include service and
                  digital transaction types, which were previously limited primarily to product
                  transactions.</dd>
              </dlentry>
              <dlentry>
                <dt>Impact</dt>
                <dd>Out-of-Scope treatment now extends to service and digital transaction types
                  in addition to product transactions.</dd>
              </dlentry>
            </dl>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- ============ BLOC: EU Member States (Pattern B - bulk update grid) ============ -->
      <div outputclass="country-card">
        <p outputclass="country-header"><b>European Union &#8212; Member States</b></p>
        <div outputclass="country-body">
          <div outputclass="bulk-card">
            <p outputclass="bulk-badge">Bulk Update</p>
            <p outputclass="taxtype-label">Value Added Tax (VAT)</p>
            <p outputclass="change-title"><b>OSS Distance-Selling Threshold Alignment</b></p>
            <dl outputclass="change-fields">
              <dlentry>
                <dt>Citation</dt>
                <dd>EU Council Directive 2026/778</dd>
              </dlentry>
              <dlentry>
                <dt>Effective Date</dt>
                <dd>2026-05-21</dd>
              </dlentry>
              <dlentry>
                <dt>Description</dt>
                <dd>Several member states aligned their domestic distance-selling registration
                  thresholds to the harmonized EU-wide OSS threshold as part of the same
                  directive. Affected member states are listed below.</dd>
              </dlentry>
            </dl>
            <table frame="all" outputclass="bulk-grid">
              <title>Affected jurisdictions</title>
              <tgroup cols="4">
                <colspec colname="c1" colnum="1" colwidth="1.5*"/>
                <colspec colname="c2" colnum="2" colwidth="2*"/>
                <colspec colname="c3" colnum="3" colwidth="1*"/>
                <colspec colname="c4" colnum="4" colwidth="2.5*"/>
                <thead>
                  <row>
                    <entry>Jurisdiction Code</entry>
                    <entry>Jurisdiction Name / Level</entry>
                    <entry>Effective Date</entry>
                    <entry>Description of Change</entry>
                  </row>
                </thead>
                <tbody>
                  <row>
                    <entry>FR</entry>
                    <entry>France / Member State</entry>
                    <entry>21 May 2026</entry>
                    <entry>Domestic threshold retired in favor of the &#8364;10,000 EU-wide OSS
                      threshold</entry>
                  </row>
                  <row>
                    <entry>IT</entry>
                    <entry>Italy / Member State</entry>
                    <entry>21 May 2026</entry>
                    <entry>Domestic threshold retired in favor of the &#8364;10,000 EU-wide OSS
                      threshold</entry>
                  </row>
                  <row>
                    <entry>ES</entry>
                    <entry>Spain / Member State</entry>
                    <entry>21 May 2026</entry>
                    <entry>Domestic threshold retired in favor of the &#8364;10,000 EU-wide OSS
                      threshold</entry>
                  </row>
                </tbody>
              </tgroup>
            </table>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

